            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "700530101",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "#Heya, {NICKNAME}! I was just thinking about you! It's been ages since I last saw you — there's so much we gotta chat about!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "700530102",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "My father made a batch of new fireworks yesterday, and I helped him out! The clients were a couple of newlyweds."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700530103",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "I told my father to use all sorts of vibrant colors in the formula. Here's to hoping that explosion of colors will become a part of their wonderful memories together."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700530104",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "And wouldn't you know it, Sayu dropped by yesterday! We even ended up chatting about you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700530105",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "*sigh* So much has happened while you've been away. There's so much you need to catch up on!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "700530106",
                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                    "text": "But that's more than enough about me! I didn't even say a proper hello... or ask what you're doing out here.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "700530107",
                            "text": "It's been a while, Yoimiya.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "700530108",
                                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                                    "text": "Sure has! And what a coincidence to run into you here, luck must be on my side. Is there anything special going on here today?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "700530111",
                                            "text": "I'm on a quest to take pictures of lovely scenery, and I bumped into you on the way.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "700530112",
                                                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                                                    "text": "Ooh, pictures of Amakane Island? I like it here too! I especially love coming here to test my fireworks whenever I've got the time."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "700530115",
                                                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                                                    "text": "Ooh, wait, I've got an idea! I just so happen to have brought some new fireworks with me."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "700530116",
                                                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                                                    "text": "Once you've got the Kamera ready, we can set these off. That way, it'll make for an even more momentous memento!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "700530117",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "And I can take a picture of you while we're here."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "700530118",
                                                    "speaker": "Yoimiya",
                                                    "text": "Awesome! I bet a picture with fireworks going off in the background will be the best kind of picture there is."
                                                },
